@startuml ci_pipeline
title Feature Branches CI and Main CI/CD Pipeline

start
:Determine changed paths;
:Run applicable checks\nin parallel;
:check_gate;
fork
  :Build firmware and filesystem\nif applicable and checks passed;
  :Report sizes if built;
fork again
  :Build native application\nif applicable and checks passed;
end fork
:build_gate;
fork
  :Run unit tests if applicable\nand build gate passed;
fork again
  :Run native API tests if applicable\nand build gate passed;
end fork
:test_gate;
:Build Doxygen docs if applicable\nand test gate passed;
:ci_status aggregates phase results;
stop
@enduml
